---

### Complete `.gitignore`

```gitignore

# Ignore .DS_Store files across the entire repository
**/.DS_Store

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environments
env/
venv/
ENV/
.venv/
.VENV/

# Byte-compiled files
*.swp
*.swo

# IDE specific
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log

# OS-specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python environments
Pipfile
Pipfile.lock
*.env
*.virtualenv

# Miscellaneous
*.bak
*.tmp